{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788026290322841001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"principal-missing-emu","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"30ae60610c69853e5bc8f3efa3d6883842f67ac1b918d27e0da32b3a06bad286","event_uuid":"6fee2185-cb35-475e-bd3a-669eb9709254","position":{"commit_sha":"f03d9c71db73266602047aa0c9c91c2a6ae44e32","position":"1788023687157783739-6fee2185-cb35-475e-bd3a-669eb9709254"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"40904171221a837767be8c5a3fad7080b3820ec9014a82193d01189125c5950c","event_uuid":"e04cc3de-d99b-49a3-b31d-20bdff86ea5b","position":{"commit_sha":"d45214ecec49359e45d62a858deced644b08e93c","position":"1788023713166039934-e04cc3de-d99b-49a3-b31d-20bdff86ea5b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"043b67fb7f31eb3e9b100254e3c6faa8f4b369f09c3e5bf3881785e9a157b635","event_uuid":"94cf1637-d203-41ea-a3f0-9b9b94ff053c","position":{"commit_sha":"003d04c129562e73e38e924f57868710564a8630","position":"1788023919262657001-94cf1637-d203-41ea-a3f0-9b9b94ff053c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788023687157783739,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"e04cc3de-d99b-49a3-b31d-20bdff86ea5b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"eab8-2009-2c59-46c7"},{"link_uuid":"94cf1637-d203-41ea-a3f0-9b9b94ff053c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b2dc-b1ab-0bd9-47f6"}],"description":"# Intermittent bridge_run_failures during 2026-08-26->28 sweep window\n\n## Impact\nThe reconcile-bridge recorded **5 isolated single-hour failures** over the sweep window. Each\nself-cleared, so no sustained outage, but the pattern is recurring and there is no open ticket\ntracking it. Unlike the closed sustained-outage bug eab8 (exceedable-giant-mussel, a pydantic\n`SecretStr` import regression fixed 2026-08-18), these are sparse transient failures with a\ndifferent signature.\n\n## Evidence — CloudWatch (rebar/host:bridge_run_failures, Sum>0 per hour, PDT)\n- 2026-08-26 20:00\n- 2026-08-27 15:00\n- 2026-08-27 19:00\n- 2026-08-27 22:00\n- 2026-08-28 01:00\n\nAlarm `rebar-bridge-run-failures` (2-of-2 hourly datapoints > 0) flapped ALARM->OK three times:\n- 08-27 19:09 -> 19:47 PDT\n- 08-27 22:10 -> 23:09 PDT\n- 08-28 01:12 -> 02:10 PDT\n\n## Root-cause status\nUNKNOWN — the box does not ship bridge logs to CloudWatch Logs in us-east-1 (only lmn-*/snap-*\nlog groups exist), so the failing reconcile passes cannot be root-caused from CloudWatch alone.\nNote some of these hours overlap the box-wide disk-fill / disk-pressure incident (see the\ngerrit-data-disk-high bug), so bridge runs may have failed under disk pressure — worth checking\nwhether these failures correlate with reclaim/pressure events on the box.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Pull the reconcile-bridge journald/log lines for the 5 timestamps above and classify the\n      failure(s).\n- [ ] Determine whether they are disk-pressure-induced (correlate with the data-disk incident)\n      or an independent transient (network/Jira/auth), and fix the class or document as benign.\n\n## Notes\nFiled by a READ-ONLY AWS ops sweep; no AWS mutation performed.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","b2dc-b1ab-0bd9-47f6"],["relates_to","eab8-2009-2c59-46c7"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ops","aws-sweep","bridge","reconciler"],"ticket_id":"97e2-5165-38c2-4d9b","ticket_type":"bug","title":"[bridge-run-failures] Intermittent reconcile-bridge failures: 5 isolated hourly failures over 2026-08-26->28 (alarm flapped 3×)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6fee2185-cb35-475e-bd3a-669eb9709254","e04cc3de-d99b-49a3-b31d-20bdff86ea5b","94cf1637-d203-41ea-a3f0-9b9b94ff053c"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788026290322841001,"uuid":"4ae00796-8f89-42c9-b389-03549ed2b76c"}